{%- doc -%}
The open/closed marker shared by the header's dropdown menus and the localization selectors, so a
navigation menu and a language menu read as the same control.

Both icons are rendered and the stylesheet swaps them on the activator's aria-expanded, which is the
only state either component exposes -- header-dropdown-menu and x-popover both set it, and neither
gives the marker a hook of its own.
{%- enddoc -%}

<span class="plus-minus-toggle" aria-hidden="true">
  {%- render 'icon' with 'custom-plus-icon', class: 'plus-minus-toggle__plus' -%}
  {%- render 'icon' with 'custom-minus-icon', class: 'plus-minus-toggle__minus' -%}
</span>
